CrossOver 26.3.0's changes to Wine, ported from Wine 11.0 onto upstream
Wine 11.16.

Source: the CrossOver 26.3.0 source release by CodeWeavers, Inc.
(crossover-sources-26.3.0.tar.gz, LGPL 2.1 or later, like Wine). The
changes are CodeWeavers' work; where Wine 11.16 moved or rewrote the code
they touch, they were adapted by hand in an unrecorded agent session on
2026-08-29 and recovered on 2026-09-27 from the source tree that built
engine builds 14-18. One deliberate difference from that tree: CrossOver's
IOKit/usb/IOUSBLib.h configure check is restored (the port had lost it,
compiling out winebus.sys/bus_xbox360.c).

Generated files: configure is regenerated from configure.ac by
scripts/apply-wine-series.sh; include/config.h.in is carried here and
matches autoheader's output.

